# Secret material must never be read or rewritten by a formatter.
#
# Prettier is invoked by `pnpm format`, and by `pnpm quick` (pretty-quick) from the
# husky pre-commit hook. A formatter that opens a credential export can echo its
# contents in an error, and a formatter that *rewrites* one corrupts it silently.
#
# .gitignore does not apply to Prettier. These mirror the secret section of
# .gitignore and the ignorePatterns in .eslintrc.js -- keep all three in step.
# See AGENTS.md section 9.
flowise-credentials-backup-*.json
*credentials-backup*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*service-account*.json
**/*secret*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
